description: |
  Extract rendered content from web pages using Chrome browser automation. Navigates to the specified URL, waits for full page rendering, and extracts clean text content while preserving structure and converting links to markdown format. Useful for summarization, enrichment, or analysis of external content within playbooks or investigations. Note: This action does not bypass Cloudflare or other anti-bot protections. If access is blocked, content extraction will fail.
